{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "At the Travel Agent"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Making Hotel Reservations"}, {"type": "position", "content": 7}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > City Shoppers > Vacation Clothes"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 4}, {"type": "level", "content": "A1.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information, involving apologies, thanks, suggestions and invitations in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le04ob07re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Making and Responding to Suggestions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "There are different ways of making and responding to suggestions.<br> Some are formal and some are casual.  <br>You can make and respond to suggestions using modals, like <span class=\"italic\">could</span>, <span class=\"italic\">should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">would</span>. <br/>Review the chart:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Making a Suggestion\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding to a Suggestion\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">How about ... ?<br> You should ...<br> Why not ... ?<br> You could ...<br> Would you ... ?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Good idea.<br> Great suggestion.<br> OK.<br></span>  <span class=\\\"italic\\\"><br>I don't know ...<br> I'd rather not ...<br> Mm, I don't like ...<br></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Hotel Etiquette in North America"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you stay at a hotel in North America, it is polite to tip the housekeeping staff (the people who clean your room) and the bellboy (the person who carries your bags and suitcases).<br>  <br>These are suggestions for how much you can tip:<br>  <br>For housekeeping: about 3 dollars a night. Leave the money on the table near the phone at the end of your stay.<br>  <br>For the bellboy: about 1-2 dollars per bag.<br>  <br>In some countries, you do not tip. It is not polite. Be sure to read about the customs in the country you want to visit.<br>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "single room"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a room for one person at a hotel "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I would like a single room, please."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob07aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use at a hotel."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "double room"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a room for two people at a hotel"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to stay in a double room please."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob07aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "continental breakfast "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a light breakfast in a hotel that usually includes baked goods, jam, fruit, and coffee"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I would like the continental breakfast."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob07aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "balcony "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a platform outside a room at a hotel or apartment building"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: All of our rooms have balconies."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob07aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "minibar"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small fridge in a hotel room with drinks and snacks "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: All of our rooms have a minibars."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob07aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to inquire "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to ask about a service"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'd like to inquire about your rates."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob07aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "per"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "for each "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(preposition)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The room rate is $80 per night."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob07aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "rate "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "cost "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The single room rate is $80 per night."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob07aud08"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Prepare a dialogue. You call a hotel."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask them about their room rates, rooms and breakfasts."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a short summary of the information (7-8 sentences)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Change roles."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about travel."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask for information."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write information on hotels."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1}, {"id": 2, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"typ